<title>AUSTRIA: Bank Austria sees higher 1997 group net.</title>
<headline>Bank Austria sees higher 1997 group net.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank Austria, the country's top bank, said on Thursday it expected full-year group net profit to be above last year's level.</p>
<p>&quot;That also applies to operating profit,&quot; chief executive Gerhard Randa told a news conference.  </p>
<p>The bank last week reported a 39 percent drop in 1996 net profit to 1.587 billion schillings from 2.587 billion a year earlier despite a one percent rise in operating profit to 5.397 billion. -- Vienna newsroom, +431 53112 274</p>
